# Image published from https://github.com/zaitrarrio/orbis → GHCR
# Paste into Vast template "Docker Options" (ports + env only).
# Image: ghcr.io/zaitrarrio/orbis:cuda128
# Filter offers: RTX 4090 | RTX 5090 | H100, CUDA ≥ 12.8 where listed.

-e NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=all
-e NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=compute,utility
-e PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
